sequenceDiagram
  actor Sec as Security Reviewer
  participant API as Product API
  participant Safe as Operational Safety
  participant EX as Execution Service
  participant DB as SQLite

  Sec->>API: activate emergency stop + reason
  API->>Safe: set_emergency_stop(true)
  Safe->>DB: runtime flag + audit event
  Sec->>API: POST /executions/{id}/recover + reason
  API->>EX: recover_execution
  EX->>DB: require emergency stop + RUNNING execution
  EX->>DB: require expired lease + unchanged fence
  alt recovery admissible
    EX->>DB: mark INTERRUPTED / outcome INDETERMINATE
    EX->>DB: mark request FAILED + append receipt + audit
    EX-->>API: recovered execution projection
  else state changed / lease active / stop inactive
    EX-->>API: fail closed
  end
  Note over Sec,DB: Recovery records uncertainty; it does not claim provider rollback.